{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/Description_Teeth_Top.png?t=1742935972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/Dim_StoreDescription.png?t=1742935972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You Shouldn't Be Here</strong> is a short psychedelic visual novel that takes place in a strange world filled with harrowing creatures. You\u2019ll meet Dimitriv who is willing to keep you safe as long as you help him with <i>something</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story touches on topics such as mental health, exclusion, and various other existential questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gritty pixel-art, together with the somewhat erratic and despairing soundtrack, intends to create a dreamlike, bordering on nightmarish, atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/Dim_DescPoem_Top.png?t=1742935972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the shape of the infinite, I am one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Swallowed by an ocean of bliss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No choices to be made,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>no stories to unfold,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>no riddles to solve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No, nothing at all\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/Dim_DescPoem_Bot.png?t=1742935972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You really shouldn\u2019t be here..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com